{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t法國內政部及巴黎檢察院公布的最新資料顯示，當地過去的星期六在全國範圍發生的示威活動中，共有404人被捕，其中在巴黎有134人被捕，當中79人被拘留審查。<br/>\n<br/>\n法國內政部就說，星期六全國共有50名警員及憲兵受傷，暫未交代他們的傷勢。<br/>\n<br/>\n根據內政部，星期六法國全國共有137場示威活動，超過10萬人參加。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T17:25:38.523819+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:50:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:49:01.265682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T17:18:41.748398+00:00","content_hash":"e597d76e550cdbacad83e089250f01f17eebe1d607ed680eadfcdd01d0053680","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}